<%#
    The BetterDesk logo (files in .ui-rework/brand), drawn inline so the
    wordmark follows --text (currentColor) and the mark follows the theme
    (--logo-square, --logo-circle, --logo-overlap in tokens.css).
    Shown when branding.logoType is "default".

    Options (prefixed, because includes also see the page's own locals):
      bdLogoName       app name; "BetterDesk" (or empty) shows mark and wordmark,
                       any other name shows the mark followed by that name
      bdLogoHeight     height of the full logo in px (default 20)
      bdLogoMarkHeight height of the mark in px (default 24)
      bdLogoCompact    also draw the mark alone (.brand-logo-compact) for the
                       page CSS to show instead of the full logo where it is tight
      bdLogoNameClass  class of the name next to the mark (default "brand-name")
      bdLogoMarkOnly   draw only the mark, as decoration (for previews)

    The full logo keeps at least the circle's radius (0.36 of its height) of
    clear space; the page CSS around it is responsible for that. The wordmark
    is drawn 1.3 times its size in the brand file, centred on the mark.
%><%
